# Retail Sales Analysis

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing online retail sales data using Python. The main objective is to understand sales performance, customer purchasing patterns, and product performance.

## Tools and Technologies
- Python
- Google Colab
- Pandas
- Matplotlib

## Dataset
Online Retail Dataset containing transaction details such as Invoice Number, Product Description, Quantity, Unit Price, Invoice Date, Customer ID, and Country.

## Data Cleaning
- Checked missing values.
- Removed rows containing missing values.
- Identified and removed duplicate records.
- Created a TotalSales column using Quantity × UnitPrice.

## Data Analysis
- Total revenue calculation.
- Country-wise sales analysis.
- Monthly sales trend analysis.
- Top 10 products by sales.
- Top 10 customers by sales.

## Visualizations
- Top 10 countries by sales.
- Monthly sales trend.
- Top 10 products by sales.
- Top 10 customers by sales.

## Conclusion
This project helps understand retail sales performance and identify important products, customers, and markets through data analysis and visualization.

